HEA electrocatalysis temporal forecasting

This project contains original modifications and domain-specific analyses built
on ideas and publicly released resources from the materials_concepts project by
Marwitz et al. The upstream software is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later. See:

https://github.com/aimat-lab/materials_concepts
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18466587
https://doi.org/10.1038/s42256-026-01206-y

All project software in src/, tests/, and tools/ is distributed under
GPL-3.0-or-later unless a file states otherwise. Derived factual annotations
and numerical result tables are intended for release under CC BY 4.0. Publisher
PDFs, abstract-derived text, and licensed database exports are not redistributed
and retain their original rights.

Substantial modifications include HEA element-set normalization, reaction
ontology, leakage-controlled rolling temporal splits, chemistry descriptors,
positive-unlabelled and survival baselines, frozen out-of-time validation,
independent-index auditing, human-label reliability analysis, and a time-stamped
forward prediction portfolio.

